    "text": "By Active NorCal ,\n1 days ago Two days after taking second place at a wrestling tournament in Sacramento, 19-year-old Ryan George was hiking with friends near Illilouette Fall in Yosemite when he slipped off the trail and fell roughly 400 feet to his death. George, a Santa Rosa Junior College sophomore and Montgomery High School graduate,... Read full article\n3",
